---
/**
 * UUID 生成器工具页
 */
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
---

<ToolLayout title="UUID生成器（Beta）">
  <link slot="head" rel="preload" type="text/javascript" as="script" href="https://rs.kdxiaoyi.top/res/scripts/js/uuid@11.1.0/dist/esm-browser/index.js" />
  <link slot="head" rel="preload" type="text/javascript" as="script" href="/webtool/code/javascript/uuidg.worker.js" />
  <link slot="head" rel="stylesheet" href="/webtool/code/css/uuidg.css" />

  <s-card id="confCard" class="main-card">
    <s-picker id="uuid-version-picker" label="UUID版本" value="4" style="width: 100%;">
      <s-picker-item value="1">V1 ‖ 基于MAC地址与当前时间戳（受限于浏览器，实际采用虚拟MAC生成）</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="3">V3 ‖ 基于MD5算法的固定UUID计算</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="4">V4 ‖ 纯随机算法</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="5">V5 ‖ 基于SHA-1算法的固定UUID计算</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="6">V6 ‖ 基于重排时间戳</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="7">V7 ‖ 基于48位毫秒时间戳和强随机数</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="8">V8 ‖ 用户自定义生成算法（本工具实际采用V4版本）</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="1_6">V1与V6互转（尚未实现）</s-picker-item>
    </s-picker>
    <br><br>
    <s-text-field id="howmany-uuid" label="生成数量" value="1" type="number">
      <div id="howmany-uuid-notice" slot="text"></div>
    </s-text-field>
    <s-picker id="uuid-format" label="输出格式" value="string">
      <s-picker-item value="string">字符串 String</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="bin">二进制 BIN</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="binA">二进制数组 Array[BIN]</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="dec">十进制 DEC</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="decA">十进制数组 Array[DEC]</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="hexA">十六进制数组 Array[HEX]</s-picker-item>
      <s-picker-item value="base64">Base64编码</s-picker-item>
    </s-picker>
    <div id="v3_5-conf" style="display: none;">
      <br>
      <s-text-field readonly="true" id="uuidv3_5-namespace-custom" label="命名空间" value="6ba7b810-9dad-11d1-80b4-00c04fd430c8">
        <s-picker id="uuidv3_5-namespace-select" slot="end" label="预设命名空间" value="6ba7b810-9dad-11d1-80b4-00c04fd430c8">
          <s-icon-button slot="trigger">
            <s-icon name="chevron_down"></s-icon>
          </s-icon-button>
          <s-picker-item value="custom">自定义</s-picker-item>
          <s-picker-item value="6ba7b810-9dad-11d1-80b4-00c04fd430c8">ns:dns</s-picker-item>
          <s-picker-item value="6ba7b811-9dad-11d1-80b4-00c04fd430c8">ns:url</s-picker-item>
          <s-picker-item value="6ba7b812-9dad-11d1-80b4-00c04fd430c8">ns:oid</s-picker-item>
          <s-picker-item value="6ba7b814-9dad-11d1-80b4-00c04fd430c8">ns:x500</s-picker-item>
        </s-picker>
      </s-text-field>
      <s-text-field id="uuidv3_5-name" label="名称" value="kdxiaoyi.top">
        <div id="howmany-uuid-notice" slot="text"></div>
      </s-text-field>
    </div>
    <br>
    <s-tooltip>
      <s-checkbox slot="trigger" id="isCapitalized" checked="false"> 使用大写 </s-checkbox>
      不对Base64模式生效：输出结果是否自动大写
    </s-tooltip>
    <s-tooltip>
      <s-checkbox slot="trigger" id="isDashUsed" checked="true"> 使用中划线 </s-checkbox>
      仅对字符串模式生效：是否使用「-」号分割UUID
    </s-tooltip>
    <br>
    <s-tooltip>
      <s-button slot="trigger" id="actionBtn-spawn">
        <s-circular-progress id="actionBtn-spawn-loading" indeterminate="true" slot="start"></s-circular-progress>
        生成
      </s-button>
      立即生成指定数量的UUID并打印在下方；<br>
      同时保存页面设置，使刷新或下次加载页面时自动按相同配置生成一次。（todo）
    </s-tooltip>
    <s-tooltip>
      <s-button slot="trigger" id="actionBtn-copy" type="elevated">
        <s-icon slot="start"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M360-240q-33 0-56.5-23.5T280-320v-480q0-33 23.5-56.5T360-880h360q33 0 56.5 23.5T800-800v480q0 33-23.5 56.5T720-240H360Zm0-80h360v-480H360v480ZM200-80q-33 0-56.5-23.5T120-160v-560h80v560h440v80H200Zm160-240v-480 480Z"></path></svg></s-icon>
        复制
      </s-button>
      将生成的UUID全部复制到剪贴板中。<br>
      需要浏览器支持Clipboard API，否则报错。
    </s-tooltip>
    <s-tooltip>
      <s-button slot="trigger" id="actionBtn-download" type="elevated">
        <s-icon slot="start"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M480-320 280-520l56-58 104 104v-326h80v326l104-104 56 58-200 200ZM240-160q-33 0-56.5-23.5T160-240v-120h80v120h480v-120h80v120q0 33-23.5 56.5T720-160H240Z"></path></svg></s-icon>
        下载
      </s-button>
      将生成的UUID下载到本地。
    </s-tooltip>
    <s-tooltip>
      <s-button slot="trigger" id="actionBtn-clearAll" type="elevated">
        <s-icon slot="start"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M280-120q-33 0-56.5-23.5T200-200v-520h-40v-80h200v-40h240v40h200v80h-40v520q0 33-23.5 56.5T680-120H280Zm400-600H280v520h400v-520ZM360-280h80v-360h-80v360Zm160 0h80v-360h-80v360ZM280-720v520-520Z"></path></svg></s-icon>
        清空
      </s-button>
      清空所生成的UUID。
    </s-tooltip>
  </s-card>

  <s-card id="resultCard" class="main-card">
    <div id="result-renderer">
      <div id="line-numbers"></div>
      <textarea id="result-renderer-text" readonly>Initalizing……</textarea>
    </div>
  </s-card>

  <script slot="scripts" is:inline src="/webtool/code/javascript/uuidg.js"></script>
</ToolLayout>
